(As a Manager in the WMD Query Portal, you hold a unique DUAL ROLE. \(1\) As a QUERY RECEIVER \(Assigned Manager\), you) Tj
T* (receive queries from Account Managers and from fellow Managers, provide mandatory Solution Remarks, request Completion) Tj
T* (Date Extensions when needed, and mark "Mgr Done" within the 48-hour SLA to protect your KPI score. \(2\) As a QUERY) Tj
T* (SENDER, you can submit queries to other Managers, add Sender Remarks, approve/decline extension requests on queries you) Tj
T* (sent, verify resolutions \("Sender Done"\), and rate the receiving Manager \(1-5 Stars\).) Tj
